        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 24 at 3:41PM CDT until September 24 at 4:00PM CDT by NWS Midland/Odessa TX</headline>
        <description>At 340 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 14 miles north of
Kent, moving northeast at 10 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of west
central Reeves and east central Culberson Counties.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
